# Community Language Adapters

Each language gets its own directory under `adapters/`.

Reference: `lh_standard_adapter/` (Python, canonical)

Bounties: See Issues #1-#5 for active language adapter bounties.

Current bounties:
- #1 JavaScript/TypeScript (npm)
- #2 Go (go modules)  
- #3 Rust (crates.io)
- #4 Java/Kotlin (Maven Central)
- #5 Ruby (RubyGems)
